{title: Blessed Be the Name}
{subtitle: Psalms 113:1–3}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 82}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [Bbmaj7] | [Eb] | [Bb] [Bbmaj7] |
| [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]Praise you [F/A]servants of the [Gm]Lord
[Eb]Lift up your voices [Bb]high
[Gm]Praise the [F/A]name of the [Gm]Lord
Let the song [Eb]fly
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
From this time [Bb/D]forth
And forever[Eb]more
The blessing en[Gm7]dures
Ever[Fsus4]more [F]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Blessed be the [F]name of the [Gm]Lord
[Eb]From [Bb]rising sun [F]to setting [Eb]light
His [Bb]glory shines [F]without [Gm]end
In the [Eb]day and [F]in the [Bb]night [Bbmaj7][Eb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]High above [F/A]all nations [Gm7]stands He
[Eb]His glory lifts to the [Bb]sky [F/A]
[Gm7]Who is like [F]the Lord our [Eb]God
Enthroned on high
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Gm7]Who is like [F]the Lord our [Eb]God
Enthroned on [Bb]high [F/A]
[Gm7]Who is like [F]the Lord our [Eb]God
Enthroned on [Fsus4]high
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Blessed be the [F]name of the [Gm]Lord
[Eb]From [Bb]rising sun [F]to setting [Eb]light
His [Bb]glory shines [F]without [Gm]end
In the [Eb]day and [F]in the [Bb]night [F/A]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Gm]He stoops [F]down to look up[Eb]on
The [Bb]heavens and the [F]earth be[Eb]low
The [Gm]Lord is [F]high a[Eb]bove all nations
His glory is the [F]show
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Blessed be the [F]name of the [Gm]Lord
[Eb]From [Bb]rising sun [F]to setting [Eb]light
His [Bb]glory shines [F]without [Gm]end
In the [Eb]day and [F]in the [Bb]night
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Eb]Hallelu[F]jah
Praise the name of the [Bb]Lord
{end_of_verse}
